## temporary files
tmp/
_out/
## Documentation site
# The generated site (Verso HTML + doc-gen4 API + test reports + PDF) is published to the
# orphan `gh-pages` branch by scripts/publish-pages.sh, NOT committed to main — so the
# often-regenerated artifact never churns main's history. (The 437 already-committed docs/
# commits are removed from history via git filter-repo in the deferred cleanup step.)
/docs
# CI staging dir for the site swap in "Copy Verso output to docs/" (removed on success)
/docs.new
# Ignore stray top-level HTML files to prevent accidental commits outside the site tree
/*.html
